ightgray; text-align: center;\"><\/th>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray; text-align: center;\">2' x 8'<\/th>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray; text-align: center;\">4' x 8'<\/th>\n    <\/tr>\n  <\/thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray; text-align: center;\">Thickness<\/th>\n      <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center;\">12 mm<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray; text-align: center;\">Weight<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">38.5 lbs<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">77 lbs<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray; text-align: center;\">Material<\/th>\n      <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center;\">High Density Poly Ethylene<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray; text-align: center;\">Load Capacity<\/th>\n      <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Up to 80 Tons (210psi) on hard surfaces<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n  <\/tbody>\n<\/table>","width":"66%","alignment":"center"}}},"block_order":["template--14498159001729__0d72f363-ade5-4fe4-ba0e-abdaacb810a8-1684936863110cd631-0","template--14498159001729__0d72f363-ade5-4fe4-ba0e-abdaacb810a8-1684936863110cd631-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"full_width":false,"space_around":true}},"0ca13775-f59b-4e2e-95da-cadc2614c60c":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14533773754497__0ca13775-f59b-4e2e-95da-cadc2614c60c-text_block-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/7_a546d295-afb1-4de1-be06-fb0b22d86662.jpg","image_width":300,"title":"STANDARD SURFACE","text":"<p>Our standard surface is smooth for easy interaction with the outrigger foot and is easy to clean before storing for the next job.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14533773754497__0ca13775-f59b-4e2e-95da-cadc2614c60c-text_block-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/6_192efcbf-4189-4bf4-9be8-f6265291a28c.jpg","image_width":300,"title":"SAFETY GRIND","text":"<p>Rough grind of the pad for non slip surface on black or safety orange Custom Composite.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14533773754497__0ca13775-f59b-4e2e-95da-cadc2614c60c-text_block-3":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/5_604233d7-78d9-496c-8b6f-2548974a34f3.jpg","image_width":300,"title":"SAFETY BIG GRIP","text":"<p>The engineered design of the safety grips greatly reduces the chance of slipping by interlocking when stacked. Big Grip also digs into the ground if there are icy or slippery conditions.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14533773754497__0ca13775-f59b-4e2e-95da-cadc2614c60c-text_block-1","template--14533773754497__0ca13775-f59b-4e2e-95da-cadc2614c60c-text_block-2","template--14533773754497__0ca13775-f59b-4e2e-95da-cadc2614c60c-text_block-3"],"custom_css":[],"settings":{"title":"SELECT THE RIGHT SURFACE FOR YOUR NEEDS","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"d1a405f0-7704-4ea8-9257-b4b072c901f3":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"e56d6d90-bcc7-4791-a619-016575cd8b2b":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1_3078dcc8-c596-43d9-ba5c-956f52c59f11.png","image_width":170,"title":"Safety","text":"<p>Our outrigger pads have been crafted to provide a safe job site from crane failures and collapses.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"22f64825-28fd-4bb3-b5fa-93e931982eef":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2_6cbd0f8a-acfb-4ade-9237-0d3706c97a76.png","image_width":170,"title":"Stability","text":"<p>The perfect solution in maximizing stability for heavy duty work.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"07250f99-ab02-4220-950f-047e1d5c234f":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/3_bd81e6a2-2d77-49e7-a0ba-91171d6947c7.png","image_width":170,"title":"Strength","text":"<p>Bigfoot's custom composite blend was formulated for maximum compressive load ratings.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14498159001729__d1a405f0-7704-4ea8-9257-b4b072c901f3-16851408782a3382ed-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Artboard_28-8_1.png","image_width":170,"title":"GREAT TRACTION","text":"<p>The mats have unique patterns that provide excellent traction, making it easy for machinery to move on any surface<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14498159001729__d1a405f0-7704-4ea8-9257-b4b072c901f3-16851408782a3382ed-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Artboard_26-8_1.png","image_width":170,"title":"HEAVY DUTY","text":"<p>These mats are designed to accommodate the weight of machinery as heavy as cranes and excavators<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14498159001729__d1a405f0-7704-4ea8-9257-b4b072c901f3-16851408782a3382ed-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Artboard_30-8_1.png","image_width":170,"title":"Long-lasting","text":"<p>The mats' impressive durability and resistance to moisture ensure they last a long time<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"ccc66f1b-7578-492e-b5fd-2aa71ed0d44a":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Artboard_25_1-8_1.png","image_width":170,"title":"WEATHERPROOF","text":"<p>The mats are immune to mold, frost, and do not absorb water, maintaining their quality in various weather conditions<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"c94e2d8f-729c-4554-acb2-0b692fdd36da":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Artboard_29-8_1.png","image_width":170,"title":"EASY TO CARRY","text":"<p>Designed to be easily carried and transported<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["e56d6d90-bcc7-4791-a619-016575cd8b2b","22f64825-28fd-4bb3-b5fa-93e931982eef","07250f99-ab02-4220-950f-047e1d5c234f","template--14498159001729__d1a405f0-7704-4ea8-9257-b4b072c901f3-16851408782a3382ed-0","template--14498159001729__d1a405f0-7704-4ea8-9257-b4b072c901f3-16851408782a3382ed-1","template--14498159001729__d1a405f0-7704-4ea8-9257-b4b072c901f3-16851408782a3382ed-2","ccc66f1b-7578-492e-b5fd-2aa71ed0d44a","c94e2d8f-729c-4554-acb2-0b692fdd36da"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"bf2a28ec-f9a5-4f16-890f-58be7e189d2f":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14498159001729__bf2a28ec-f9a5-4f16-890f-58be7e189d2f-168494678495535239-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.rich_text_heading_2.value }}"}}},"block_order":["template--14498159001729__bf2a28ec-f9a5-4f16-890f-58be7e189d2f-168494678495535239-0"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"edc0ad68-a6be-412e-9659-c3c61b75e10e":{"type":"advanced-content","blocks":{"template--14498159001729__edc0ad68-a6be-412e-9659-c3c61b75e10e-168494579725b2471c-1":{"type":"liquid","disabled":true,"settings":{"code":"<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr style=\"background-color: white;\">\n      <th style=\"background-color: white;\"><\/th>\n      <th style=\"background-color: #FF334E; text-align: center;\">Plywood<\/th>\n      <th style=\"background-color: #FF334E; text-align: center;\">VIPER DECK 500<\/th>\n    <\/tr>\n  <\/thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray;\">Lifespan<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">1-3 Projects<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">5+ Years<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray;\">Traction<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">🚫 Slippery when wet<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">✔ Rugged Pattern for Maximum Traction<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray;\">Load Capacity<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">🚫 Limited<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">✔ Up to 80 tonnes<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray;\">Surface<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">🚫 Unstable<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">✔ Joined by connectors to keep a firm platform<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray;\">Weather Resistent<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">🚫<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">✔<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray;\">Safety<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">🚫 Hazardous, Easily cracks<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">✔ Durable Material<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray;\">Maintenance<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">🚫<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">✔ Easy to Clean, Washable<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n  <\/tbody>\n<\/table>","width":"100%","alignment":"center"}},"15ea0e57-c8bb-47f4-90f6-a50b2ef923f9":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_3_image.value }}","link":"","width":"100%","alignment":"center"}}},"block_order":["template--14498159001729__edc0ad68-a6be-412e-9659-c3c61b75e10e-168494579725b2471c-1","15ea0e57-c8bb-47f4-90f6-a50b2ef923f9"],"settings":{"full_width":false,"space_around":true}},"f7ec193b-423f-426b-87ef-fcaaa0b50ddd":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14533773754497__f7ec193b-423f-426b-87ef-fcaaa0b50ddd-text_block-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"{{ product.metafields.custom.text_columns_with_images_image_1.value }}","image_width":650,"title":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14533773754497__f7ec193b-423f-426b-87ef-fcaaa0b50ddd-text_block-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"{{ product.metafields.custom.text_columns_with_images_image_2.value }}","image_width":650,"title":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14533773754497__f7ec193b-423f-426b-87ef-fcaaa0b50ddd-text_block-3":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"{{ product.metafields.custom.text_columns_with_images_image_3.value }}","image_width":650,"title":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14533773754497__f7ec193b-423f-426b-87ef-fcaaa0b50ddd-text_block-1","template--14533773754497__f7ec193b-423f-426b-87ef-fcaaa0b50ddd-text_block-2","template--14533773754497__f7ec193b-423f-426b-87ef-fcaaa0b50ddd-text_block-3"],"settings":{"title":"See our ground protection mats Transforming These SITES","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"product-recommendations":{"type":"product-recommendations","settings":{"show_product_recommendations":true,"product_recommendations_heading":"You may also like","related_count":5}},"98e028a1-601b-4c5d-b26b-fc597b6d3a0c":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"template--14498159001729__98e028a1-601b-4c5d-b26b-fc597b6d3a0c-16850334293c1835df-0":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"How do our Ground Protection Mats protect your expensive turf?","text":"<p>Our Ground Protection Mats help spread out the weight of wheels and equipment. This stops them from sinking into the ground and damaging the grass. One big problem for grass is when the soil gets packed down too tightly. Viper Deck Protection mats help avoid this problem because they cover a wide area.<\/p>"}},"template--14498159001729__98e028a1-601b-4c5d-b26b-fc597b6d3a0c-16850334293c1835df-1":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"What is the weight capacity of our Ground Protection Mats?","text":"<p>Our ground protection mats are tested to handle pressure up to 210 psi, which means they can safely carry heavy weights of up to 80 tons. They work well on grassy fields, sandy areas, and mixed stone surfaces for different uses.<\/p>"}},"f1e6822d-3e21-4028-bb57-612c9a43439e":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Can I drive and use our Ground Protection Mats?","text":"<p>Yes, you can use our ground  Protection Mats on the ground, for protection and stability for all kinds of vehicles and loads. This includes big trucks, forklifts, backhoes, pickup trucks, and other heavy machines.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14498159001729__98e028a1-601b-4c5d-b26b-fc597b6d3a0c-16850334293c1835df-0","template--14498159001729__98e028a1-601b-4c5d-b26b-fc597b6d3a0c-16850334293c1835df-1","f1e6822d-3e21-4028-bb57-612c9a43439e"],"settings":{"title":"FAQs"}},"7832703d-d5ca-4bdf-adbc-6260488743e0":{"type":"contact-form","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"title":"Questions, Inquiries, & Custom Quotes","text":"<p>For any questions, inquiries, or to get a quote on our Ground Protection Mats for your project, feel free to contact us below.<\/p>","show_phone":false,"narrow_column":true}},"16808712840b63fa95":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"7c9bb0fe-699c-4847-af7f-b7a00e6c190c":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/reviews\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}}},"block_order":["7c9bb0fe-699c-4847-af7f-b7a00e6c190c"],"settings":{"full_width":false,"space_around":true}},"e98b186a-cb19-48cb-8775-57d1b1ee5ebe":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"19395395-ab98-4ad2-8cb6-274c48ffe6a1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS"}},"c2c28a4a-2065-470b-9375-0248492fed55":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p><a href=\"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/pages\/frequently-asked-questions-bigfoot-outrigger-pads\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/pages\/frequently-asked-questions-bigfoot-outrigger-pads\"><strong>Got Questions? Learn more about our Bigfoot Outrigger Pads ❗HERE<\/strong><\/a>❗<\/p>"}}},"block_